{
  "name": "AI Translation Pipeline with Quality Check",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "translate-text",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Webhook - Translation Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "message",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Translate the following text to {{ $json.body.target_language || 'English' }}.\n\nPreserve:\n- Tone and style\n- Technical terminology\n- Formatting and structure\n- Cultural nuances (localize idioms appropriately)\n\nReturn ONLY the translated text, nothing else.\n\nSource text:\n{{ $json.body.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 3000
        }
      },
      "name": "OpenAI - Translate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst translatedText = items[0].json.message.content;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    originalText: items[0].json.body?.text || '',\n    translatedText: translatedText,\n    targetLanguage: items[0].json.body?.target_language || 'English',\n    sourceLanguage: items[0].json.body?.source_language || 'Auto-detect'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Code - Prepare for QA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "message",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a professional translation quality assessor. Rate this translation on a scale of 1-10.\n\nEvaluate:\n1. **Accuracy** (1-10): Does it convey the same meaning?\n2. **Fluency** (1-10): Does it read naturally in the target language?\n3. **Terminology** (1-10): Are technical terms correct?\n4. **Style** (1-10): Is the tone preserved?\n5. **Overall** (1-10): Weighted average\n\nReturn JSON:\n{\n  \"accuracy\": 9,\n  \"fluency\": 8,\n  \"terminology\": 9,\n  \"style\": 8,\n  \"overall\": 8.5,\n  \"issues\": [\"brief issue descriptions\"],\n  \"suggestions\": [\"improvement suggestions\"]\n}\n\nSource ({{ $json.sourceLanguage }}):\n{{ $json.originalText }}\n\nTranslation ({{ $json.targetLanguage }}):\n{{ $json.translatedText }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokens": 1000
        }
      },
      "name": "OpenAI - Quality Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1000, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst qaResponse = items[0].json.message.content;\nlet qa;\ntry {\n  qa = JSON.parse(qaResponse);\n} catch(e) {\n  qa = { overall: 5, accuracy: 5, fluency: 5, terminology: 5, style: 5, issues: ['Could not parse QA'], suggestions: [] };\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...items[0].json,\n    qualityScore: qa.overall || 0,\n    accuracy: qa.accuracy || 0,\n    fluency: qa.fluency || 0,\n    terminology: qa.terminology || 0,\n    style: qa.style || 0,\n    issues: Array.isArray(qa.issues) ? qa.issues.join('; ') : '',\n    suggestions: Array.isArray(qa.suggestions) ? qa.suggestions.join('; ') : '',\n    approved: (qa.overall || 0) >= 8,\n    date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Code - Parse QA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.qualityScore }}",
              "value2": 8,
              "operation": "largerEqual"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "IF - Quality >= 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "gid=0" },
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Date": "={{ $json.date }}",
            "Source Language": "={{ $json.sourceLanguage }}",
            "Target Language": "={{ $json.targetLanguage }}",
            "Original": "={{ $json.originalText }}",
            "Translation": "={{ $json.translatedText }}",
            "Quality Score": "={{ $json.qualityScore }}",
            "Status": "=Approved"
          },
          "schema": [
            { "id": "Date", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Source Language", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Target Language", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Original", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Translation", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Quality Score", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Status", "type": "string", "display": true }
          ],
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Google Sheets - Approved",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1750, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "gid=0" },
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Date": "={{ $json.date }}",
            "Source Language": "={{ $json.sourceLanguage }}",
            "Target Language": "={{ $json.targetLanguage }}",
            "Original": "={{ $json.originalText }}",
            "Translation": "={{ $json.translatedText }}",
            "Quality Score": "={{ $json.qualityScore }}",
            "Issues": "={{ $json.issues }}",
            "Suggestions": "={{ $json.suggestions }}",
            "Status": "=Needs Review"
          },
          "schema": [
            { "id": "Date", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Source Language", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Target Language", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Original", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Translation", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Quality Score", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Issues", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Suggestions", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Status", "type": "string", "display": true }
          ],
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Google Sheets - Flagged for Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1750, 450],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 900,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## AI Translation Pipeline with Quality Check\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Connect OpenAI API and Google Sheets OAuth2\n2. Set spreadsheet IDs for approved translations and flagged-for-review sheets\n3. POST to webhook: `{\"text\": \"text to translate\", \"target_language\": \"Spanish\", \"source_language\": \"English\"}`\n\nTranslates text, then runs a second AI pass for quality scoring. Score >= 8 auto-approved, below 8 flagged for human review with issues and suggestions."
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 550]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook - Translation Request": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "OpenAI - Translate", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "OpenAI - Translate": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Code - Prepare for QA", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Code - Prepare for QA": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "OpenAI - Quality Score", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "OpenAI - Quality Score": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Code - Parse QA", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Code - Parse QA": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "IF - Quality >= 8", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "IF - Quality >= 8": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Google Sheets - Approved", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Google Sheets - Flagged for Review", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}